<title>USA: CompuDyne Corp 1996 year profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>CompuDyne Corp 1996 year profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>WILLIMANTIC, Conn. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.09     loss	 $0.40</p>
<p> Net profit		   331     loss	   663</p>
<p> Net Sales		 22,142		   10,308</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   3,554		    1,657</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 figues not provided by company.</p>
<p>Continuing operations produced a profit of $391,000 or $0.11 per share compared to a loss of $210,000 or $0.13 per share in 1995.</p>
